  "homeIntroHtml": "<h1>Lab of Efficient Machine Intelligence</h1>\n<p>The <strong>E</strong>fficient <strong>M</strong>achine <strong>I</strong>ntelligence (<strong>EMI</strong>) research lab @ <strong>TU Delft</strong> focuses on <strong>neuromorphic algorithm-hardware co-design for </strong><strong>energy-efficient edge intelligence</strong>. </p>",
